+(Required, string)
+
+`<rule_id>`::
+(Required, string)
+
+[[get-query-rule-response-codes]]
+==== {api-response-codes-title}
+
+`400`::
+Missing `ruleset_id` or `rule_id`, or both.
+
+`404` (Missing resources)::
